# QA M4 acceptance: the whole journey in one run of the real game, from the
# title through Salzburg, St. Gilgen, Brunnwinkl and Falkenstein (the
# qa_m3_accept_full_route inputs, Falkenstein cleared with the Hackl), the
# route map in Wait, START (13501) -> the St. Wolfgang intro as Hackl Resi
# with the run carried over (D-056, D-071), then a handwritten Hackl route
# through Stage 5 at walking pace: M-box Mozartkugel (1000, stays Hackl),
# over the garden wall, stand #1's globe shatters on the curb, over the
# counter and awning, axe on Selfie-Tourist #1, the whole Schafbergbahn ride
# standing, stomp Selfie-Tourist #2 at the Alm, bus #1 watched from the
# terrace, bus #2's photo stop waited out on the shelter, checkpoint (16505),
# over the bench into tourist #3's pen, axe on him, M-box (1000), basin ->
# Pilgerbrunnen canopy, stomp tourist #4 (step off the basin's right end
# into the sunken lane, bounce through its 3 Oblaten), stomp stand #2's
# globe, awning -> steps -> church terrace, point-blank axes on the Pilger pair,
# bump the H-box (Hackl stays), down to the street, under balcony B1
# (singer #1 sings into the sky), axe on singer #2, along the street through
# both decorative Kaiserterrasse posts (233, 242), the Seebad in two jumps,
# axe on stand #3's globe, awning (the 100th Oblate, extra life, now falls before it), step,
# landing hall, walk off to the Maibaum (100). St. Wolfgang LevelComplete at
# ~19146, the tally, then the route map St. Wolfgang -> Wolfgangsee (from
# ~19608): no level yet, so the teaser, still with Hackl Resi and the run (it
# turns to the title at ~19852, covered by qa_m4_flow_st_wolfgang_teaser_title).
# The replay ends in the teaser. Re-cut for the pen-wall fix (D-066
# addendum): a hop out of the Ried dip onto the station step, a longer walk
# on the Alm terrace (a tile lower) to trigger bus #1, a fuller hop over the
# 2-high bench, and the Markt from the M-box to the church terrace (+43
# frames from there on).
level  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1772..1772 deaths=0 no_event=Died no_event=Hurt event=AxeHit event=ExtraLife event=CheckpointReached
expect = state=route_map stage=st_wolfgang power=hackl lives=6 score=99650 oblaten=3
